{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "8244712",
      "title": "Creating a Configurable & Flexible Custom Button Component",
      "sourceHash": "a80eff35b0741247c21167bbec4fc5282dc3b6911a36784e5412e45d5dfb2dd5",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.99,
          "end": 3.69,
          "en": "So let's work on the buttons next.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.69,
          "end": 7.77,
          "en": "And for that I'll add a separate UI sub folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.77,
          "end": 11.61,
          "en": "in my components folder, since I have a couple of components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.61,
          "end": 13.74,
          "en": "in this app here that are basically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.74,
          "end": 17.343,
          "en": "just core generic UI building blocks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.21,
          "end": 22.11,
          "en": "Of course, all components in the end are UI building blocks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.11,
          "end": 24.63,
          "en": "but there are certain building blocks like buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.63,
          "end": 26.973,
          "en": "that are needed all over the place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.96,
          "end": 31.95,
          "en": "And I'll put such components into that UI folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.95,
          "end": 35.28,
          "en": "which is just a convention I personally like to follow",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.28,
          "end": 37.803,
          "en": "but not a convention you have to adopt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.24,
          "end": 43.833,
          "en": "But here I'll add a new Button.jsx file in that UI folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.73,
          "end": 49.73,
          "en": "And here we can then export this Button component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 51.51,
          "end": 54.63,
          "en": "And here, of course, I wanna return the default button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 54.63,
          "end": 57.693,
          "en": "but now styled in a certain way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 59.73,
          "end": 61.95,
          "en": "Now for that, we of course also will need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 61.95,
          "end": 63.57,
          "en": "to accept some props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 63.57,
          "end": 67.41,
          "en": "because I want to accept the children prop, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 67.41,
          "end": 70.14,
          "en": "so that we can still use this custom button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 70.14,
          "end": 74.28,
          "en": "like the built-in button and wrap it around the text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 74.28,
          "end": 76.443,
          "en": "that should be output on the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 77.46000000000001,
          "end": 78.93,
          "en": "And of course, you learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 78.93,
          "end": 82.47,
          "en": "that if you wrap a custom component around something,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 82.47,
          "end": 85.23,
          "en": "around some text or JSX code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 85.23,
          "end": 87.695,
          "en": "that text or JSX code will be received",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 87.695,
          "end": 91.41,
          "en": "through that built in children prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 91.41,
          "end": 93.3,
          "en": "And it's therefore this children prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 93.3,
          "end": 97.14,
          "en": "which I also want to use here to output that content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 97.14,
          "end": 99.50999999999999,
          "en": "which is passed between my button tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 99.50999999999999,
          "end": 101.313,
          "en": "between these button tags.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.93,
          "end": 105.72,
          "en": "But that's just one thing I want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105.72,
          "end": 109.22999999999999,
          "en": "In addition, I also want to support",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 109.22999999999999,
          "end": 113.72999999999999,
          "en": "different kinds of buttons with different styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 113.72999999999999,
          "end": 115.92,
          "en": "I basically want to have buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 115.92,
          "end": 117.66,
          "en": "that have a background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.66,
          "end": 120.84,
          "en": "and that look like big buttons on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.84,
          "end": 124.92,
          "en": "And then I also wanna have text only buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.92,
          "end": 128.073,
          "en": "which in the end is just some clickable text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 129.03,
          "end": 134.03,
          "en": "And therefore here I'll accept a textOnly prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 134.88,
          "end": 136.713,
          "en": "or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 137.88,
          "end": 142.88,
          "en": "And I'll then add cssClasses constant here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 143.34,
          "end": 147.45,
          "en": "which takes a look at text only.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 147.45,
          "end": 151.17000000000002,
          "en": "And if that is true, I want to add a CSS class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 151.17000000000002,
          "end": 155.4,
          "en": "of text-button to this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 155.4,
          "end": 159.333,
          "en": "Otherwise it should be just the button CSS class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 160.95,
          "end": 165.42000000000002,
          "en": "In addition, I also wanna make sure that theoretically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 165.42000000000002,
          "end": 168.899,
          "en": "the button styling could also be adjusted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 168.899,
          "end": 170.46,
          "en": "from outside this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 170.46,
          "end": 173.28300000000002,
          "en": "by adding more CSS classes to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 174.39,
          "end": 179.13,
          "en": "So in addition, I'll also extract the class name prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 179.13,
          "end": 183.09,
          "en": "so that this prop can also be set on my custom component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 183.09,
          "end": 186.78,
          "en": "And I wanna merge this into the hard-coded classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 186.78,
          "end": 187.653,
          "en": "I have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 188.7,
          "end": 191.82,
          "en": "To achieve this, we can of course convert these strings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 191.82,
          "end": 196.82,
          "en": "to template literals and simply inject class name like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 197.73,
          "end": 202.73,
          "en": "into both, or alternatively, keep these classes as strings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 205.44,
          "end": 208.68,
          "en": "convert this from a constant to a variable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 208.68,
          "end": 213.68,
          "en": "and then simply append the class name like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 216.72,
          "end": 219.15,
          "en": "separated by some white space here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 219.15,
          "end": 221.97,
          "en": "so that we don't build one long class name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 221.97,
          "end": 225.453,
          "en": "but we instead have multiple class names on that button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 226.29,
          "end": 228.27,
          "en": "It's of course, totally up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 228.27,
          "end": 230.91,
          "en": "how you wanna merge this incoming class name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 230.91,
          "end": 233.28300000000002,
          "en": "with those hard-coded class names here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 234.9,
          "end": 237.15,
          "en": "But with that, we can then add class name here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 237.15,
          "end": 239.94299999999998,
          "en": "to the button and set this to cssClasses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 240.93,
          "end": 243.513,
          "en": "So to this variable I just worked on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 245.37,
          "end": 249.09,
          "en": "And now as a last but very important step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 249.09,
          "end": 251.16,
          "en": "I of course also wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 251.16,
          "end": 253.77,
          "en": "that my button in the end can be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 253.77,
          "end": 255.543,
          "en": "just like the built-in button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 256.41,
          "end": 260.1,
          "en": "That, for example the type can be set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 260.1,
          "end": 264.363,
          "en": "that the on click prop can be set, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 265.83,
          "end": 268.41,
          "en": "And to achieve this, we could of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 268.41,
          "end": 272.04,
          "en": "accept and extract all these props here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 272.04,
          "end": 275.85,
          "en": "but we would have to add a very long list of props here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 275.85,
          "end": 278.433,
          "en": "to cover all possible use cases.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 279.48,
          "end": 281.49,
          "en": "A way simpler alternative",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 281.49,
          "end": 286.49,
          "en": "is to use this rest properties syntax here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 287.55,
          "end": 291.18,
          "en": "where you basically look for all other props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 291.18,
          "end": 294.81,
          "en": "you might be getting, all other properties that are set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 294.81,
          "end": 297.63,
          "en": "on that incoming props object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 297.63,
          "end": 300.39,
          "en": "and you merge them into a new object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 300.39,
          "end": 303.453,
          "en": "a new object called props in my case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 304.5,
          "end": 306.57,
          "en": "And that will then simply be an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 306.57,
          "end": 308.55,
          "en": "that contains all the other props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 308.55,
          "end": 310.05,
          "en": "that might have been set here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 311.07,
          "end": 312.712,
          "en": "And it's now this props object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 312.712,
          "end": 315.51,
          "en": "that should be spread onto this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 315.51,
          "end": 319.17,
          "en": "which thankfully also is pretty easy to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 319.17,
          "end": 321.723,
          "en": "by using this syntax here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 324.21,
          "end": 328.05,
          "en": "So with that here, we're collecting all remaining props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 328.05,
          "end": 330.27,
          "en": "and we're then spreading those props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 330.27,
          "end": 333.693,
          "en": "onto the button element, the built-in button element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 336.45,
          "end": 339.78,
          "en": "And with that, we should have a reusable button component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 339.78,
          "end": 342.543,
          "en": "and we can get started using that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 343.53,
          "end": 347.19,
          "en": "For example, in the Header component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 347.19,
          "end": 350.55,
          "en": "There I have a button, which now should be built",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 350.55,
          "end": 352.533,
          "en": "with that new custom button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 353.752,
          "end": 357.51,
          "en": "Therefore, here we can import this Button component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 357.51,
          "end": 359.703,
          "en": "from ./UI button.jsx,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 362.85,
          "end": 365.13,
          "en": "and then replace the built-in button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 365.13,
          "end": 366.963,
          "en": "with this custom button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 368.67,
          "end": 371.79,
          "en": "And here, I won't add onClick yet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 371.79,
          "end": 374.1,
          "en": "because we're not dealing with clicks yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 374.1,
          "end": 379.1,
          "en": "But I wanna make sure that here I got this text only style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 380.13,
          "end": 383.64,
          "en": "So therefore I wanna set text only here to true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 383.64,
          "end": 385.113,
          "en": "on this custom button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 386.04,
          "end": 387.63,
          "en": "And this can easily be done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 387.63,
          "end": 390.69,
          "en": "by simply adding the textOnly prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 390.69,
          "end": 393.9,
          "en": "You could set it to true like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 393.9,
          "end": 395.94,
          "en": "but that's actually not required",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 395.94,
          "end": 398.34000000000003,
          "en": "because just adding a prop like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 398.34000000000003,
          "end": 401.523,
          "en": "will automatically set it to true in React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 403.8,
          "end": 404.7,
          "en": "And with that here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 404.7,
          "end": 406.776,
          "en": "I should have this text only button style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 406.776,
          "end": 408.78,
          "en": "And if we save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 408.78,
          "end": 411.78,
          "en": "you therefore should not have a button that looks like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 413.64,
          "end": 415.47,
          "en": "Now, on those meal items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 415.47,
          "end": 417.96,
          "en": "I want to have that other button style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 417.96,
          "end": 421.35,
          "en": "and therefore we should go to the MealItem component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 421.35,
          "end": 426.35,
          "en": "and also import the custom button there from the UI folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 427.77,
          "end": 429.843,
          "en": "and then the Button.jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 431.76,
          "end": 436.29,
          "en": "and then go down to this button and here use it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 436.29,
          "end": 438.33,
          "en": "just like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 438.33,
          "end": 441.63,
          "en": "And again, here, we don't need any other props for now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 441.63,
          "end": 444.663,
          "en": "because we're also not handling clicks here yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 446.7,
          "end": 449.82,
          "en": "And with that, those meal items now look nicer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 449.82,
          "end": 452.64,
          "en": "and we got those clickable buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 452.64,
          "end": 456,
          "en": "And therefore, I'd say as a next step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 456,
          "end": 458.76,
          "en": "it probably makes sense to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 458.76,
          "end": 461.07,
          "en": "that these buttons can be clicked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 461.07,
          "end": 464.25,
          "en": "and that we start managing some cart data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 464.25,
          "end": 467.73,
          "en": "which we then at some point can also display in a modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
